{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Usages","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Usages"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some products may have heavy and very rich user interfaces with a lot of components and elements to displays and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with which users can interact. Thus for such products there are specific constraints of spaces and sizes, even if","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"these products must be Orange flavored.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"That is the reason why this team is created: a kind of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeTheme"},{"text":" but wih adjustments on some tokens like spacings and sizings.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To get the theme:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Integration","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Integration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To use this theme, inject it to your view using ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"text":" and get it through environment variable.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["    @main","    struct YourApp: App {","        var body: some Scene {","            WindowGroup {","                OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeCompactTheme()) {","                    \/\/ Your root view","                }","            }","        }","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Theme-tuning","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Theme tuning"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The theme can be customized a bit for more flexibility thanks to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tuning"},{"text":" object.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You just need to give a predefined tuning configuration at theme init to build the one you need.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To apply the tuning:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["    \/\/ Define your theme tuning","    let tuning = Tuning(hasRoundedButtons: true,","                        hasRoundedTextInputs: true,","                        hasRoundedAlertMessages: false,","                        hasRoundedProgressIndicators: true,","                        hasRoundedListItems: true)","","    \/\/ Apply it to your theme","    let theme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: tuning)","","    \/\/ Or apply predefined tunings","    let orangeFranceTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeFrance)","    let orangeBusinessTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeBusiness)","    let maxitTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: Tuning.MaxIt)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Typography","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Typography"},{"anchor":"Helvetica-Neue","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Helvetica Neue"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Orange brand strongly relies on the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}]},{"text":" font family. Thus each Orange brand should, or must, use it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For iOS the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}]},{"text":" font family is available at system level, so it is not needed to get it through external assets.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"By default an instance of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeCompactTheme"},{"text":" uses as font family the token ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault"},{"text":", which is today ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If you want to use another font family, you will have to send the suitable token or the suitable font family.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, beware, iOS API relies also on the PostScript name of the font.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To be sure of the value to use, look at the font book of your device.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It is recommended to use the font raw tokens.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["    \/\/ The following instanciations work","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme()","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault)","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: \"HelveticaNeue\") \/\/ Which is PostScript name of the font","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: \"Helvetica Neue\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Helvetica-Neue-Arabic","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Because the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}]},{"text":" font family does not manage arabic alphabet but latin one, it is possible apply another font family to the theme like the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic","type":"text"}]},{"text":". This font family assets can be retrieved through the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PostScript name management has been implemented for this font family, thus the weight are managed and it is only needed to add the font assets to the project,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"register them and define the font family name to use.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: \"Helvetica Neue Arabic\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Tokens-versions","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Tokens versions"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Core OUDS version: 1.11.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Core Orange version: 1.2.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Brand Orange Compact version: 2.7.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Since","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.17.0","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"Orange Compact","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" theme is an Orange theme but tailored for some products with heavy UI."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/init(fontFamily:tuning:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/name"],"generated":true}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange Compact"}],"externalID":"s:23OUDSThemesOrangeCompact0bC5ThemeC","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OrangeCompactTheme","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class","role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"inheritsFrom","title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme"]},{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/SQ","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"https://brand.orange.com/en/brand-basics/typography":{"title":"Orange Brand website (authentication needed)","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Brand website (authentication needed)"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/OrangeCompactTheme":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OrangeCompactTheme","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Orange Compact"},{"type":"text","text":" theme is an Orange theme but tailored for some products with heavy UI."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"Theme Orange Compact","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The Orange Compact theme is dedicated to applications with strong dimensions constraints.","type":"text"}],"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orangecompact.png"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"ic_theme_orangecompact.png":{"type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/ic_theme_orangecompact.png"}],"identifier":"ic_theme_orangecompact.png","alt":null},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/OrangeCompactTheme/init(fontFamily:tuning:)":{"type":"topic","title":"init(fontFamily:tuning:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"fontFamily","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FontFamilySemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic010FontFamilyB5Tokena"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tuning","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tuning","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract6Tuninga"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme\/init(fontfamily:tuning:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/init(fontFamily:tuning:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Constructor of the OrangeCompact theme with its own providers of tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It uses also the providers of charts colors from Orange theme ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeThemeColorChartSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/OrangeCompactTheme/name":{"type":"topic","title":"name","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"name","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme\/name","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/name","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme name (“Orange Compact”)"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/OUDSTheme":{"type":"topic","title":"OUDSTheme","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/oudstheme","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This is a basic theme any theme must be a subclass off, or all themes must have as ancestor."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A Swift "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"class"},{"type":"text","text":" has been used so as to allow to easily override some attributes and have inheritance, without having for developers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to implement all tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Any properties of an overridable theme should be defined so as to provide defaults values."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"We allow this theme to be derivated and be overridden."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be seen as a kind of “abstract class” in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"object oriented paradigm"}]},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"theme contract"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" is not a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"final"}]},{"type":"text","text":" class, its type cannot be seen as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":", that is the reason why this conformity is unchecked."}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/SQ":{"title":"Swift.Equatable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/SQ"}}}